Package: edgeai-tidl-models
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: ABI-validated TI EdgeAI TIDL models for AM67A/J722S
 RegNetX-200MF ONNX and TI MobileNetV1 TFLite image-classification models
 compiled with TI 11_02_16_00 tools for the AM67A/J722S C7x-MMA. All 103 ONNX
 nodes and all 34 TFLite operators are offloaded. The package records compiler
 inputs, reference data, and output hashes for reproducibility.
 .
 The models are installed below /opt/model_zoo/.
